From 688283387d38b525c4244967a4a2c2ce93b1b3ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 04:44:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(work): use screenshot cover for DV Legales, drop www
 from URL
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two small adjustments to the DV Legales work entry:

- Cover: replace the generated SVG placeholder with an actual screenshot
  of the dvlegales.com.ar hero, captured at the site's initial load
  state ('Asesoramiento legal integral. Criterio estratégico y cercanía
  real.'). Stored as optimized 1600x1000 JPG (~116 KB each). The
  language-agnostic coverImage and both coverByLang variants all point
  to the same screenshot since there's no per-language cover content.
- liveUrl: drop the 'www.' prefix — dvlegales.com.ar is the canonical
  domain and 'www.' now just redirects.

Removes: public/work/dvlegales-cover*.svg
Adds:    public/work/dvlegales-cover*.jpg
---
 lib/work.ts                        |   8 +++---
 public/work/dvlegales-cover-en.jpg | Bin 0 -> 118493 bytes
 public/work/dvlegales-cover-en.svg |  42 -----------------------------
 public/work/dvlegales-cover-es.jpg | Bin 0 -> 118493 bytes
 public/work/dvlegales-cover-es.svg |  42 -----------------------------
 public/work/dvlegales-cover.jpg    | Bin 0 -> 118493 bytes
 public/work/dvlegales-cover.svg    |  30 ---------------------
 7 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 118 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover-en.jpg
 delete mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover-en.svg
 create mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover-es.jpg
 delete mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover-es.svg
 create mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover.jpg
 delete mode 100644 public/work/dvlegales-cover.svg

